  "steps": [
    "Wash the masoor dal and cook it with turmeric, salt and 3 cups of water until completely soft, about 15 minutes on the stove or 3 whistles in a cooker.",
    "Mash the dal with a ladle and keep it on a low flame.",
    "Heat the oil in a pan, add cumin seeds, and when they crackle add garlic and green chilli.",
    "Add the onion and cook until golden brown, then add the tomato and cook until the oil starts to separate.",
    "Stir in chilli powder and coriander powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add this masala to the dal, simmer for 5 minutes, then stir in garam masala and coriander leaves."
  ]
